		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>White haired Lhasa apso dog with human-like hand-paws. Hunt Elysium's plains.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +5 (1d6) or bay, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bay</strong>. All chaotic mortals who hear, WIS 12+ or terrified for 1d6 rounds. Audible distant.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Good</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lick</strong>. Dog's licking heals 2d6 HP or cures one disease or poison.</p><p></p><p><strong>Plane Shift</strong>. 1/day, can shift to Astral or Ethereal Plane or back to the mortal world.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
